Create or Update Runner flow: {
  shape: sequence_diagram
  User
  Dotcom
  Runner
  IMS
  User opens 'New Runner' or 'Edit runner' page: {
    User -> Dotcom: Open 'New Runner' or\n'Edit runner' page or\ncall REST API
    Dotcom -> IMS: Get list of curated images\navailable for user
    IMS -> Dotcom: The list of images
    Dotcom -> User: Render page
  }

  User creates or updates a runner: {
    User -> Dotcom: Create or Update runner
    Dotcom -> Runner: Creating a new runner\nwith specified image id
    Runner -> IMS: Get an image by image id
    IMS -> Runner: Image details or 'NotFound'
    Runner -> Runner: Confirm that image exists and\nthe image is enabled for user
    Runner -> Dotcom: Result of Runner creation
    Dotcom -> User: Show results in UI
  }
}
